{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARK. THAT. THING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>WIDE LOAD</strong>, the precision parking <i>chaos simulator</i> you never asked for\u2014but absolutely need. Take control of an 18-wheeler and try to wedge, slide, drift, or <i>pray</i>\u00a0into parking spaces that definitely weren't built with you in mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2757<strong>FEATURES</strong>\u2757</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ridiculous Trailer Handling</strong> \u2013 Long? Bendy?  Yup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Parking Madness</strong> \u2013 \u201cPerfect parking\u201d or \u201cperfect disaster\u201d \u2014 your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road and Vehicle Modifiers</strong> \u2013 Oops all\u2026 <i>despair.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedruns?</strong> \u2013 Beat the timer or beat your dignity. Both work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Leaderboards</strong> - Race against your steam friends or the globe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong> - Brag to your friends about how cool you are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crash Physics</strong> \u2013 Spectacular? Yes. Useful? No.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Run Mode</strong> \u2013 Only gameplay for time built into the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Panic Moments</strong> \u2013 You\u2019ll know when.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support and UI</strong> - We got you controller users!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WIDE LOAD</strong><br>We <i>can\u2019t wait</i> to see what you do with your <strong>WIDE LOAD</strong>.<br><br><strong>Wide Load is a physics-based parking simulator where precision meets chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate tight turns, dodge traffic, and steer your\u00a0\u00a0<strong><i>w i d e\u00a0 l o a d</i>\u00a0</strong> across cliffside roads, hazards, and jumps. Master each level and race the clock to earn the fastest time - if you can park it without crashing first.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4277666d7a9bab14f1501c325785c4a45aac19cd.jpg","localized_name":"Completed Level 10","name":"Completed Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/910860/4277666d7a9bab14f1501c325785c4a45aac19cd.jpg"},{"icon":"bc2b91eabecf567bec1b70a8c45cbff0806f5354.jpg","localized_name":"Completed Level 20","name":"Completed Level 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/910860/bc2b91eabecf567bec1b70a8c45cbff0806f5354.jpg"},{"icon":"a259c34568a490ef63ce64875eef5bc00f35a49c.jpg","localized_name":"Completed Level 30","name":"Completed Level 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/910860/a259c34568a490ef63ce64875eef5bc00f35a49c.jpg"},{"icon":"e9f76ffb066cac2369f7967f77a009b97b3d27e2.jpg","localized_name":"Beat the game","name":"Beat the game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/910860/e9f76ffb066cac2369f7967f77a009b97b3d27e2.jpg"},{"icon":"469e2b2ba5eb10d28f5876ba887d9489250be961.jpg","localized_name":"Beat the game with 0 crashes","name":"Beat the game with 0 crashes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/910860/469e2b2ba5eb10d28f5876ba887d9489250be961.jpg"},{"icon":"6f03e4e06a514038bf3289a6cd4de59e90128c12.jpg","localized_name":"Crash 100 times","name":"Crash 100 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/910860/6f03e4e06a514038bf3289a6cd4de59e90128c12.jpg"},{"icon":"336d6d0040d696560239307b78ae59348ec9b6e6.jpg","localized_name":"Honk.","name":"Honk.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/910860/336d6d0040d696560239307b78ae59348ec9b6e